# GitHub Actions workflow — kept out of git because pushing .github/workflows/*.yml
# requires the `workflow` OAuth scope, which this machine's cached git credential lacks.
# Add/edit it directly through the GitHub web UI instead. The file lives on disk at
# .github/workflows/deploy-api.yml as the source to paste.
/.github/workflows/

